{"html":"<div class=\"led-customization screen-customization\"><section class=\"led-hero\"><div class=\"container-site\"><nav class=\"led-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"面包屑\"><a href=\"/zh/\">首页</a><span>/</span><a href=\"/zh/#capabilities\">定制能力</a><span>/</span><span>丝网印刷</span></nav><div class=\"led-hero-grid\"><div><p class=\"led-eyebrow\">DECORATION CAPABILITY / SCREEN PRINTING</p><h1>鲜明品牌标识，<br>从每一道专色开始。</h1><p class=\"screen-subtitle\">杯具定制 · 丝网印刷</p><p class=\"led-intro\">油墨通过丝网模板转移到杯身外壁。围绕实际材质、可印区域与确认样品，呈现清晰的专色品牌图案。</p><div class=\"led-ctas\"><a data-screen-quote class=\"led-button\" href=\"/zh/contact/\">沟通丝网印刷项目 ↗</a><a class=\"led-button led-button-outline\" href=\"#compatible-products\">浏览对应杯型 ↓</a></div><p class=\"led-small\">图稿、颜色数、起订量与交期按具体项目确认。</p></div><div class=\"led-hero-visual\"><img src=\"/img/screen-scenes-20261024/step-4-optimized.webp\" alt=\"红色体育场杯与白色专色图案 — 场景示意\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" fetchpriority=\"high\"><div class=\"led-hero-caption\"><span>TYCB-001 / SCREEN PRINT</span><span>场景示意</span></div></div></div></div></section><details class=\"bx-process-comparison\" id=\"compare-processes\"><summary>比较六种工艺与配置：展开查看差异 →</summary><section class=\"pc-choice\" id=\"compare-processes-table\"><div class=\"pc-heading\"><p class=\"uvc-eyebrow\">COMPARE YOUR OPTIONS / BEFORE THE ARTWORK</p><h2>先选效果，再确定工艺。</h2><p>同屏比较六种定制方向。以下用于选型讨论，材质适配与最终效果以所选型号的实物试样为准。</p></div><div class=\"pc-table-wrap\"><table class=\"pc-table\"><caption class=\"pc-sr\">六种酒具定制工艺与配置对比</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">工艺／配置</th><th scope=\"col\">想要的效果</th><th scope=\"col\">杯型与材质选型</th><th scope=\"col\">打样需要确认</th><th scope=\"col\">下一步</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\"><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"pc-number\">01</span><strong>UV 印刷</strong><small>表面装饰</small></th><td data-label=\"想要的效果\">全彩 Logo、插画及选定的白墨效果。</td><td data-label=\"杯型与材质选型\">按选定塑料杯核定；硅胶需单独验证。</td><td data-label=\"打样需要确认\">可印范围、曲率、白墨底层、附着与护理。</td><td data-label=\"下一步\" class=\"pc-links\"><a href=\"/zh/uv-printing/\">查看详情 ↗</a><a href=\"/zh/contact/?models=UV%20Printing%20project\">按此方向询价 →</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"pc-number\">02</span><strong>热转印</strong><small>表面装饰</small></th><td data-label=\"想要的效果\">多彩图案和围绕杯身展开的构图。</td><td data-label=\"杯型与材质选型\">塑料杯或 LED 杯壳体，需核对耐热与夹具适配。</td><td data-label=\"打样需要确认\">热响应、锥度、转印边界、套位与附着。</td><td data-label=\"下一步\" class=\"pc-links\"><a href=\"/zh/heat-transfer-printing/\">查看详情 ↗</a><a href=\"/zh/contact/?models=Heat%20Transfer%20project\">按此方向询价 →</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"pc-number\">03</span><strong>激光标记／镭雕</strong><small>表面标记</small></th><td data-label=\"想要的效果\">随材质产生的色调或纹理标记，效果须试样。</td><td data-label=\"杯型与材质选型\">当前展示选定 Tritan 杯概念，需逐款验证可行性。</td><td data-label=\"打样需要确认\">材料反应、对比度、表面状态和约定护理测试。</td><td data-label=\"下一步\" class=\"pc-links\"><a href=\"/zh/laser-engraving/\">查看详情 ↗</a><a href=\"/zh/contact/?models=Laser%20Marking%20%2F%20Engraving%20project\">按此方向询价 →</a></td></tr><tr class=\"pc-current\"><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"pc-number\">04</span><strong>丝网印刷</strong><small>表面装饰</small><em>当前页面</em></th><td data-label=\"想要的效果\">专色色块、文字与选定的多次套印图案。</td><td data-label=\"杯型与材质选型\">体育场杯、硅胶杯等，按实际墨水体系核定。</td><td data-label=\"打样需要确认\">分色、网版、套位、附着及适用时的弯折表现。</td><td data-label=\"下一步\" class=\"pc-links\"><a href=\"/zh/screen-printing/\">查看详情 ↗</a><a href=\"/zh/contact/?models=Screen%20Printing%20project\">按此方向询价 →</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"pc-number\">05</span><strong>LED 产品定制</strong><small>灯光配置</small></th><td data-label=\"想要的效果\">灯光与品牌结合；表面印刷可另行组合讨论。</td><td data-label=\"杯型与材质选型\">LED 杯、LED 冰桶及选定酒具配件。</td><td data-label=\"打样需要确认\">灯光模式、触发方式、供电维护、清洁与包装。</td><td data-label=\"下一步\" class=\"pc-links\"><a href=\"/zh/custom-led-drinkware/\">查看详情 ↗</a><a href=\"/zh/contact/?models=LED%20Customization%20project\">按此方向询价 →</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"pc-number\">06</span><strong>遇冷变色油墨</strong><small>互动油墨</small></th><td data-label=\"想要的效果\">杯壁降温后覆盖区显色，让固定图案产生对比。</td><td data-label=\"杯型与材质选型\">已确认遇冷款；半变色、全变色变体分别核定。</td><td data-label=\"打样需要确认\">覆盖区、常温／冷态识别度、配方响应与 UV 匹配。</td><td data-label=\"下一步\" class=\"pc-links\"><a href=\"/zh/color-changing-ink/\">查看详情 ↗</a><a href=\"/zh/contact/?models=Cold%20Color-Changing%20Ink%20project\">按此方向询价 →</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"pc-help\"><p>LED 是灯光配置，可与适用的表面印刷组合。遇冷变色与 UV 组合也需要验证；无需在询盘前选定全部工艺。</p><a href=\"/zh/contact/?models=Process%20selection%20help\">还不确定？请客户经理协助选型 →</a></div></section></details>\n <section id=\"printing-journey\" class=\"led-section led-journey\"><div class=\"container-site\"><div class=\"led-section-head\"><p class=\"led-eyebrow\">FROM ARTWORK TO SAMPLE APPROVAL</p><h2>四步，完成一枚清晰印记。</h2><p>从图稿分色、网版定位，到刮印与固化，了解专色杯身印刷的关键环节。</p></div><div class=\"led-journey-grid\"><div><div class=\"led-journey-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"丝网印刷制作流程\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"screen-tab-0\" aria-controls=\"screen-panel-0\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" data-screen-step=\"0\"><span>01</span><strong>图稿与专色分色</strong><small>准备矢量图稿，将设计拆分为专色，确认印刷尺寸与颜色参考。</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"screen-tab-1\" aria-controls=\"screen-panel-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-step=\"1\"><span>02</span><strong>网版准备与杯身定位</strong><small>每个颜色准备对应网版，用适配夹具支撑杯身，将网版图案与确认印区对齐。</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"screen-tab-2\" aria-controls=\"screen-panel-2\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-step=\"2\"><span>03</span><strong>刮印与逐色套印</strong><small>刮板将油墨通过网版图文开孔转移到受支撑的杯身表面；增加颜色时需分别套位印刷。</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"screen-tab-3\" aria-controls=\"screen-panel-3\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-step=\"3\"><span>04</span><strong>固化与样品检查</strong><small>按所选油墨与基材确认固化条件，对照约定样品标准检查套位、边缘、外观与附着表现。</small></button></div><a class=\"led-text-link\" data-screen-quote href=\"/zh/contact/\">带上图稿，核对工艺方案 →</a></div><div class=\"led-journey-panels\"><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"screen-panel-0\" aria-labelledby=\"screen-tab-0\" data-screen-panel=\"0\" ><figure><img class=\"led-process-photo\" src=\"/img/screen-scenes-20261024/step-1-optimized.webp\" alt=\"图稿与专色分色 — 工艺场景示意\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"eager\"><figcaption>工艺场景示意 · 非工厂实拍<b>01 / 04</b></figcaption></figure><h3>图稿与专色分色</h3><p>准备矢量图稿，将设计拆分为专色，确认印刷尺寸与颜色参考。</p><div class=\"screen-scene-detail\">矢量图稿 · 颜色参考</div><div class=\"led-journey-controls\"><button type=\"button\" data-screen-prev disabled>← 上一步</button><span>01 / 04</span><button type=\"button\" data-screen-next >下一步 →</button></div></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"screen-panel-1\" aria-labelledby=\"screen-tab-1\" data-screen-panel=\"1\" hidden><figure><img class=\"led-process-photo\" src=\"/img/screen-scenes-20261024/step-2-optimized.webp\" alt=\"网版准备与杯身定位 — 工艺场景示意\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>工艺场景示意 · 非工厂实拍<b>02 / 04</b></figcaption></figure><h3>网版准备与杯身定位</h3><p>每个颜色准备对应网版，用适配夹具支撑杯身，将网版图案与确认印区对齐。</p><div class=\"screen-scene-detail\">丝网模板 · 杯身夹具</div><div class=\"led-journey-controls\"><button type=\"button\" data-screen-prev >← 上一步</button><span>02 / 04</span><button type=\"button\" data-screen-next >下一步 →</button></div></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"screen-panel-2\" aria-labelledby=\"screen-tab-2\" data-screen-panel=\"2\" hidden><figure><img class=\"led-process-photo\" src=\"/img/screen-scenes-20261024/step-3-optimized.webp\" alt=\"刮印与逐色套印 — 工艺场景示意\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>工艺场景示意 · 非工厂实拍<b>03 / 04</b></figcaption></figure><h3>刮印与逐色套印</h3><p>刮板将油墨通过网版图文开孔转移到受支撑的杯身表面；增加颜色时需分别套位印刷。</p><div class=\"screen-scene-detail\">刮板 · 网版与杯身接触区</div><div class=\"led-journey-controls\"><button type=\"button\" data-screen-prev >← 上一步</button><span>03 / 04</span><button type=\"button\" data-screen-next >下一步 →</button></div></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"screen-panel-3\" aria-labelledby=\"screen-tab-3\" data-screen-panel=\"3\" hidden><figure><img class=\"led-process-photo\" src=\"/img/screen-scenes-20261024/step-4-optimized.webp\" alt=\"固化与样品检查 — 工艺场景示意\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>工艺场景示意 · 非工厂实拍<b>04 / 04</b></figcaption></figure><h3>固化与样品检查</h3><p>按所选油墨与基材确认固化条件，对照约定样品标准检查套位、边缘、外观与附着表现。</p><div class=\"screen-scene-detail\">图案边缘 · 外观与附着</div><div class=\"led-journey-controls\"><button type=\"button\" data-screen-prev >← 上一步</button><span>04 / 04</span><button type=\"button\" data-screen-next disabled>下一步 →</button></div></div></div></div></div></section>\n <section class=\"led-section\"><div class=\"container-site\"><div class=\"led-section-head\"><p class=\"led-eyebrow\">SPECIFICATIONS & SAMPLE REVIEW</p><h2>生产前，先确认印刷细节。</h2></div><div class=\"led-spec-layout\"><table aria-label=\"丝网印刷规格\"><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">颜色</th><td>使用专色；网版数量与颜色参考按图稿确认。</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">印刷区域</th><td>按型号确认，避开杯口，并核对锥度、接缝与夹具空间。</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">基材与油墨</th><td>确认实际材质、表面前处理及适配油墨体系。</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">固化与附着</th><td>通过生产样品确认固化条件与附着测试方法。</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">清洁与耐用性</th><td>清洁说明及耐洗、耐摩擦测试要求另行确认。</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">起订量与交期</th><td>按型号、颜色数、图稿、数量与包装单独报价。</td></tr></tbody></table><aside><h3>适用图稿</h3><p>专色 Logo<br>清晰文字与实色图形<br>活动与推广杯图案</p><h3>需另行评估</h3><p>照片、渐变、细线及特殊表面需单独进行图稿与材质试样。</p></aside></div></div></section>\n <section id=\"compatible-products\" class=\"led-section led-sand\"><div class=\"container-site\"><div class=\"led-section-head\"><p class=\"led-eyebrow\">MODEL SHORTLIST / SCREEN PRINTING</p><h2>先选杯型，再印上你的品牌。</h2><p>六款现有塑料杯参考，用于项目选型讨论。油墨、前处理、印区与附着表现需逐款确认。</p></div><div class=\"led-products-grid\"><article class=\"led-product\"><a class=\"led-product-image\" href=\"/zh/products/16-oz-stadium-cup-smooth/\"><img src=\"/img/v88-20261023/tycb-001-0f3e3b707b.webp\" alt=\"BOOM Drinkware 16 oz. Stadium Cup - Smooth\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><div class=\"led-product-copy\"><p class=\"led-model\">TYCB-001 / PP / 16 oz / 12 oz / 32 oz</p><h3>定制16oz平滑直壁体育场杯（PP·美国产）</h3><p>现有产品参考，丝印适配以样品确认为准。</p><a class=\"led-text-link\" href=\"/zh/products/16-oz-stadium-cup-smooth/\">查看对应型号 ↗</a></div></article><article class=\"led-product\"><a class=\"led-product-image\" href=\"/zh/products/full-color-stadium-cup-tycb003/\"><img src=\"/img/v88-20261023/tycb-003-6bb09dc256.webp\" alt=\"BOOM Drinkware Full Color Stadium Cup - 16 oz\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><div class=\"led-product-copy\"><p class=\"led-model\">TYCB-003 / PP / 16 oz</p><h3>定制16oz全彩广告印刷杯（PP·美国产）</h3><p>现有产品参考，丝印适配以样品确认为准。</p><a class=\"led-text-link\" href=\"/zh/products/full-color-stadium-cup-tycb003/\">查看对应型号 ↗</a></div></article><article class=\"led-product\"><a class=\"led-product-image\" href=\"/zh/products/full-color-stadium-cup-tycb002/\"><img src=\"/img/v88-20261023/tycb-002-d5f5c51cae.webp\" alt=\"BOOM Drinkware Full Color Stadium Cup - 22 oz\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><div class=\"led-product-copy\"><p class=\"led-model\">TYCB-002 / PP / 22 oz / 32 oz</p><h3>定制22oz全彩印刷体育场杯（PP·美国产）</h3><p>现有产品参考，丝印适配以样品确认为准。</p><a class=\"led-text-link\" href=\"/zh/products/full-color-stadium-cup-tycb002/\">查看对应型号 ↗</a></div></article><article class=\"led-product\"><a class=\"led-product-image\" href=\"/zh/products/event-stadium-cup/\"><img src=\"/img/v88-20261023/tycb-004-1c69580d43.webp\" alt=\"BOOM Drinkware Event Stadium Cup - 24 oz.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><div class=\"led-product-copy\"><p class=\"led-model\">TYCB-004 / PP / 24 oz / 20 oz</p><h3>定制24oz赛事纪念体育场杯（PP·美国产）</h3><p>现有产品参考，丝印适配以样品确认为准。</p><a class=\"led-text-link\" href=\"/zh/products/event-stadium-cup/\">查看对应型号 ↗</a></div></article><article class=\"led-product\"><a class=\"led-product-image\" href=\"/zh/products/16-oz-frosted-plastic-cup/\"><img src=\"/img/v88-20261023/msb-002-b9d7d1caa3.webp\" alt=\"BOOM Drinkware 16 oz. Frosted Plastic Cup (Frost Flex)\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><div class=\"led-product-copy\"><p class=\"led-model\">MSB-002 / PP / 16 oz</p><h3>定制磨砂塑料杯 16oz（Frost Flex · 美国产）</h3><p>现有产品参考，丝印适配以样品确认为准。</p><a class=\"led-text-link\" href=\"/zh/products/16-oz-frosted-plastic-cup/\">查看对应型号 ↗</a></div></article><article class=\"led-product\"><a class=\"led-product-image\" href=\"/zh/products/16oz-matte-colored-plastic-cup-soda/\"><img src=\"/img/v88-20261023/msb-009-8140320c74.webp\" alt=\"BOOM Drinkware 16oz Matte Colored Plastic Cup Soda Can with PP Lids\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><div class=\"led-product-copy\"><p class=\"led-model\">MSB-009 / PP / 16 oz</p><h3>定制磨砂易拉罐杯 16oz（哑光纯色/渐变 · 带 PP 盖）</h3><p>现有产品参考，丝印适配以样品确认为准。</p><a class=\"led-text-link\" href=\"/zh/products/16oz-matte-colored-plastic-cup-soda/\">查看对应型号 ↗</a></div></article></div></div></section>\n <section class=\"led-section\"><div class=\"container-site\"><div class=\"led-section-head\"><p class=\"led-eyebrow\">BUYER QUESTIONS</p><h2>丝网印刷常见问题。</h2></div><div class=\"led-faq\"><details open><summary>什么图稿适合丝网印刷？</summary><p>实色专色 Logo、文字与清晰图形适合作为起点；细节、最小线宽与套色精度需按实际印刷尺寸核对。</p></details><details ><summary>丝印可以还原照片或渐变吗？</summary><p>照片与连续渐变需单独评估工艺；如需精细多彩图像，可同时比较 UV 印刷与热转印。</p></details><details ><summary>可以印多少个颜色？</summary><p>通常每个颜色需要独立网版与套位。可用颜色数取决于杯型、图稿、油墨与产线配置，在报价时确认。</p></details><details ><summary>如何确认图案耐用性？</summary><p>先约定基材、油墨体系、固化条件、清洁说明与所需测试，通过实物样品确认，不预设耐洗次数。</p></details><details ><summary>询价需要提供什么？</summary><p>请提供型号或参考图、矢量图稿、颜色参考、印刷位置、数量、包装、目的地与到货要求，并在报价中列明网版及制版费用。</p></details></div><nav class=\"led-related\" aria-label=\"其他装饰工艺\"><a href=\"/zh/uv-printing/\">UV 印刷 ↗</a><a href=\"/zh/heat-transfer-printing/\">热转印 ↗</a><a href=\"/zh/laser-engraving/\">镭雕 ↗</a></nav></div></section>\n <section class=\"led-section led-sand\"><div class=\"container-site led-rfq-grid\"><div><p class=\"led-eyebrow\">ARTWORK & PROJECT BRIEF</p><h2>带上你的 Logo，<br>开始下一步。</h2><p class=\"led-intro\">提供杯型、矢量图稿、颜色参考、数量与目的地，让报价明确印刷与制版范围。</p><a data-screen-quote class=\"led-button\" href=\"/zh/contact/\">申请丝网印刷报价 ↗</a></div><ul class=\"led-review-list\"><li>杯型、材质与数量</li><li>矢量图稿、颜色与印刷位置</li><li>网版、制版与打样费用</li><li>样品验收与清洁说明</li><li>包装、目的地与到货要求</li></ul></div></section></div>"}